   "seed": 673767655,
   "text": "WHY ATOMIC MATTERS\n\nholders can read the vault at any\nblock and every rule holds \u2014\nthere is no window in which the\nlayout is half-applied\n\nv4 flash accounting makes the\nremove + adds one settlement",
