   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 842627282,
   "text": "DUMP \u2192 sellers hit the SUPPORT band; quote turns into tokens INSIDE the pool (nothing leaves the vault).     RALLY \u2192 filled ASKS become quote just above the new price = support by itself;\nsupport only lapses once price runs past the whole ask range \u2014 which is exactly when restore() matters.",
   "originalText": "DUMP \u2192 sellers hit the SUPPORT band; quote turns into tokens INSIDE the pool (nothing leaves the vault).     RALLY \u2192 filled ASKS become quote just above the new price = support by itself;\nsupport only lapses once price runs past the whole ask range \u2014 which is exactly when restore() matters.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
